1
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:04,090
(Sheldon:)Oh, look. Saturn 3 is on.

2
00:00:04,254 --> 00:00:07,464
I don't wanna watch Saturn 3.
Deep Space Nine is better.

3
00:00:07,632 --> 00:00:10,512
(Sheldon:)How is Deep Space Nine
better than Saturn 3?

4
00:00:11,428 --> 00:00:14,268
(Raj:)Simple subtraction
will tell you it's six better.

5
00:00:16,558 --> 00:00:17,978
(Leonard:)Compromise. Watch Babylon 5.

6
00:00:18,143 --> 00:00:19,183
[CHUCKLES]

7
00:00:19,936 --> 00:00:22,276
(Sheldon:)In what sense is that a compromise?

8
00:00:22,439 --> 00:00:26,569
(Leonard:)Well, five is partway between three...
Never mind.

9
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:29,400
(Raj:)I'll tell you what.
How about we go Rock, Paper, Scissors?

10
00:00:29,571 --> 00:00:31,031
(Sheldon:)Ooh, I don't think so.

11
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:34,447
(Sheldon:)Anecdotal evidence suggests
that in a game of Rock, Paper, Scissors...

12
00:00:34,617 --> 00:00:38,117
(Sheldon:)...players familiar with each other will tie
75 to 80 percent of the time...

13
00:00:38,288 --> 00:00:40,288
(Sheldon:)...due to the limited number of outcomes.

14
00:00:40,457 --> 00:00:44,627
(Sheldon:)I suggest
Rock, Paper, Scissors, Lizard, Spock.

15
00:00:45,712 --> 00:00:48,092
(Girl:)- What?
- It's very simple.

16
00:00:48,256 --> 00:00:50,676
(Sheldon:)Scissors cuts paper, paper covers rock...

17
00:00:50,842 --> 00:00:53,432
(Sheldon:)...rock crushes lizard,
lizard poisons Spock...

18
00:00:53,595 --> 00:00:56,225
(Sheldon:)...Spock smashes scissors,
scissors decapitates lizard...

19
00:00:56,389 --> 00:00:58,639
(Sheldon:)...lizard eats paper,
paper disproves Spock...

20
00:00:58,808 --> 00:01:06,028
(Sheldon:)...Spock vaporizes rock,
and as it always has, rock crushes scissors.

